<title>SPAIN: Spain's FCC to propose 4-for-1 share split.</title>
<headline>Spain's FCC to propose 4-for-1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction group Fomento de Construcciones y Contratas S.A. (FCC) said on Monday its board would propose to shareholders a four-for-one share split.</p>
<p>If approved at the annual general meeting on June 25, the nominal share value in the group will fall to 250 pesetas from the current 1,000, FCC said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
